{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"741cd4e128c11eaa85ce499eac2a8a1d36123407e1299b0f082ef7b2c6f1683e","ja":"ディーラーとして","zh":"作为发牌员","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"be1ff1345e6201cf745ef46931470d8901af32419558c7c01676aa21ab19d0c8","ja":"……私がディーラー、ですか？","zh":"……由我来当荷官吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"fa5ea6daa913c87d55910d53989d732f9e65c05ddc90c72068a4f3fbfb5c1665","ja":"そうだヨ！　この大会の人みたいに、\nカッコいいディーラーになる練習をするノ♪","zh":"没错哟！我要练习成为像这场比赛中的人一样帅气的荷官♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"507ffc66dff1870e7422a3273964ba48b8f90101f340d6dc0cf44ea11e59ba30","ja":"私も賛成！\nなんだか楽しそうだし、やろうよ、ポーカー♪","zh":"我也赞成！\n感觉很有意思，我们来玩吧，扑克♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"71f3325391037a81253cd98ab31381a94a2873395388c8ef3cfceeea25ae32e5","ja":"わ、私もやってみたいです。\nえっと、たしか棚に……あ、トランプがありました。","zh":"我、我也想试试看。\n呃，我记得架子上……啊，有扑克牌。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"f1a0bd1a7ccdad72bc344d6b13e9aec265416fab8d23650f50199a4b1adbac34","ja":"決まりだネ！\nじゃあミズキ、やってみてヨ！","zh":"就这么定了！\n那瑞希，你来试试看吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"3e2a006f95e7239590f2ba59fc0b8f38178bb3aceebc32d744ecfad0e069e46e","ja":"はい。みなさん、ありがとうございます。\nではまず、シャッフルしてカードを配りますね。","zh":"好的。谢谢大家。\n那么，首先我来洗牌发牌。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"c49198b34c42ed0a03a0e7cceae5e26bc0c244d31e92754dbb4c64f4fc4ca8f1","ja":"せっかくなので、さっきの試合で見た、\nピッチングに挑戦してみます。","zh":"难得有这个机会，我来挑战一下刚才比赛中看到的投球。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"6332f47c91cc8afb37b1b8696647d8804a8ae34b8ddd472e3a0ffde2bf4efe82","ja":"カードを滑らせるように……えいっ。","zh":"像滑动卡片一样……嘿！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"16cf35002a40ca37ce0c40f900c606fcdb57e8132557ad68fa5d74f9e5d0d224","ja":"シュッ、シュッ、シュッ……ファサッ","zh":"唰、唰、唰……哗地一声","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"b06c711a16d7e360a335ee40ae26f037def038d618c73b7b0013e7265ac29cc9","ja":"……最後の一枚が\nひっくり返っちゃったヨ。惜しかったネ！","zh":"……最后一张牌\n翻过来了哟。真可惜呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"ac47749daa0523a851da56d0a4f31ac754673ea7c5efda0c56fd76cf14ef5ca3","ja":"むむむ……では、気を取り直してもう一度。\n……それっ。","zh":"唔唔唔……那么，重新振作起来再来一次。\n……就是这个。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"88be0533561fb7ca9c81ab0b072d7fdc1e3e47905ed64b330aa635df8d2b32ab","ja":"あっ、今のはいい感じだったかも！\nその調子で頑張って、瑞希ちゃん！","zh":"啊，刚才表现得或许很不错！\n就保持这个状态加油吧，瑞希！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"7ab6fac718cbda5e769fa5bf700982c4a0866f14eb2a972b0cebfad425db127b","ja":"瑞希さんでも、苦戦するなんて……\nか、簡単そうに見えて、難しいんですね……。","zh":"就连瑞希也会陷入苦战……\n看起来简单，没想到这么难啊……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"7a19ddcbd28d610f864b0563f181a66ace88ce28157b33c4103c4519ceee9e73","ja":"一通り練習した後、改めてルールを説明して、\n実際にポーカーをプレイしてみることになって……","zh":"练习了一遍之后，又重新说明了规则，接下来要实际玩玩扑克……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"7b6ac7d6d6ff3a17c1b6a8063b1d9bf3d3d22f0cdcba721dd45e9380c14cade1","ja":"では、手札を確認してください。\n……今度はうまく配れたぞ。","zh":"那么，请确认手牌。\n……这次发得很顺利。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"27a85893121f6120dcd00e94a5f54d953e5af9f90ee0ac0d4218d68b1883ee7d","ja":"……ウーン、なるほど。\nじゃあ、これとこれを交換して……。","zh":"……嗯，原来如此。\n那就把这个和这个交换……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[55].text","source_sha256":"06a50dd54cc1e1c529fab7aaf064945af536823d7fa197b1efc4704a3a6cd9e1","ja":"やった……あっ、な、なんでもないよ！","zh":"太好了……啊，没、没什么！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[56].text","source_sha256":"fe6c7ed6bdf76b795a0cbfe901a70b604aa56bb740f248e2fb4ba04cf70baa98","ja":"美奈子さん、もしかして……\nほ、欲しいカードが来たんじゃ……？","zh":"美奈子小姐，难道说……\n是、是你想要的卡来了……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[57].text","source_sha256":"c4b206f8a7533224bf91099d2e8cec1933474d734600b7a82d6af2b78708f738","ja":"そ、そんなことないよ！　あはははは……。","zh":"才、才不是那回事！啊哈哈哈……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1814.unity3d","item_key":"commands[65].text","source_sha256":"b6b0991401328278a0bb73077a9918f14d85f0d30254a20855b181246037c0be","ja":"（大会を見るのもいいけど、\nみんなでポーカーをするのも楽しいぞ……えへへ）","zh":"（看看比赛也不错，不过大家一起玩扑克也很有意思哦……嘿嘿）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
